      <title>阿里发布Qwen-UI-Agent，移动端基准超越GPT-5.6与Claude Opus 4.8</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260820/%E9%98%BF%E9%87%8C%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83Qwen-UI-Agent%E7%A7%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%AB%AF%E5%9F%BA%E5%87%86%E8%B6%85%E8%B6%8AGPT-5.6%E4%B8%8EClaude-Opus-4.8/</link>
